# =============================================================================
# CALLBACK URL CONFIGURATION GUIDE
# =============================================================================
#
# IMPORTANT: Update the BASE_URL, API_BASE_URL, and ADMIN_BASE_URL variables above
# with your actual domain names before using any callback URLs.
#
# Callback URL Patterns:
# - OAuth Redirect URIs: ${BASE_URL}/auth/{service}/callback
# - Webhook URLs: ${API_BASE_URL}/webhooks/{service}
# - Admin URLs: ${ADMIN_BASE_URL}/admin/{service}
#
# Example for production:
# BASE_URL=https://agent47.com
# API_BASE_URL=https://api.agent47.com
# ADMIN_BASE_URL=https://admin.agent47.com
#
# Example for development:
# BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000
# API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
# ADMIN_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000/admin
#
# Common Callback URLs to configure in third-party services:
# - Facebook: https://your-domain.com/auth/facebook/callback
# - Google: https://your-domain.com/auth/google/calendar/callback
# - LinkedIn: https://your-domain.com/auth/linkedin/callback
# - Twitter: https://your-domain.com/auth/twitter/callback
# - Instagram: https://your-domain.com/auth/instagram/callback
# - YouTube: https://your-domain.com/auth/youtube/callback
# - Discord: https://your-domain.com/auth/discord/callback
# - Reddit: https://your-domain.com/auth/reddit/callback
# - OneDrive: https://your-domain.com/auth/onedrive/callback
#
# Webhook URLs to configure in third-party services:
# - Slack: https://api.your-domain.com/webhooks/slack
# - Stripe: https://api.your-domain.com/webhooks/stripe
# - PayPal: https://api.your-domain.com/webhooks/paypal
# - Twilio: https://api.your-domain.com/webhooks/twilio
# - SendGrid: https://api.your-domain.com/webhooks/sendgrid
# - Mailchimp: https://api.your-domain.com/webhooks/mailchimp
# - Shopify: https://api.your-domain.com/webhooks/shopify
# - And many more as listed above...
